# RestA UI composition (UI8Kit essence)

## Zones

| Zone | Paths | Raw HTML |
| --- | --- | --- |
| **U** | `src/kit/**` | Allowed (atoms). Prefer codegen. |
| **L** | `index.html`, `src/App.svelte` | Document / stage / font links / tweaks |
| **C** | `src/blocks/**`, `src/components/**` | **No raw layout/typography/controls** — use kit |

## Block vs Box

- `Block` — one landmark root (`section` / `header` / `nav` / `footer` / `article`). Always set `tag`.
- `Box` — inner non-landmark shells (`div` only).
- Do not use `Block` as a generic div wrapper.

## Atoms

`Stack`, `Group`, `Title`, `Text`, `Inline`, `Button`, `Image`, `Box`, `Block` from `src/kit`.

## Landing UX

- Follow `brand/DESIGN.md` HARD CONSTRAINTS / FORBIDDEN
- Sections: hero → atmosphere → cuisine → banquet → cta (`#cta`)
- Brand name is hero-level; one headline, one support line, one CTA group, one dominant image
- Full-bleed hero; no cards or floating badges on hero media
- Semantic roles from tweaks (`primary` = terracotta CTA, brass = scarce emphasis)
- Not purple SaaS, not Inter / Roboto / Arial as brand voice

## Allowlist

- `@html` only inside sanitized markdown bodies with `// retag:allow`
